  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="e1f655a9-5546-46d4-81b3-34e1ab3db3b0"><problem><para>
      <para>For each equation in questions 1 – 5, identify the values of \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\) that you would substitute into the quadratic formula to solve the equation.</para>
      <para>\(3x^2+8x+4=0\)</para>
      <para>What is the value of \(a\)?<para>Enter the value of \(a\).</para>
        </para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>3</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(a=3\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
